<title>HONG KONG: CDW Int'l says interim loss at HK$1 mln.</title>
<headline>CDW Int'l says interim loss at HK$1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.49 loss vs  1.30 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.09 loss vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    1.00 loss vs  2.67 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     216.44    vs  214.61</p>
<p>    Company name		 CDW International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - CDW International is a textile group.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$3.09 million on sale of a 49 percent stake of its wholly owned manufacturing unit CDW International (BVI) Ltd to Dollfus Meig &amp; Cie of Paris as part of the arrangements to set up a joint venture.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
